<title>SWITZERLAND: UBS chairman sees very good H1 results.</title>
<headline>UBS chairman sees very good H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>INTERLAKEN, Switzerland 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland chairman Robert Studer on Monday predicted &quot;very good&quot; 1997 first half results.</p>
<p>&quot;It looks very good until now,&quot; Studer told Reuters Financial Television (RFTV) in an interview.</p>
<p>&quot;Results have been very positive in all business segments we are active in, and there is no reason to be pessimistic.</p>
